summary: "Invited by the division faculty to collaborate with the Academy of Interdisciplinary Studies (AIS) on an office renovation, I was tasked with refreshing the department's brand identity and translating its narrative into a large-scale environmental wallpaper design. Extending from the core geometry of the logo, I anchored the entire design system on a single primitive element: the dot."
